s PASS: aerated DO=8.45 pH=8.330 > passive DO=4.17 pH=6.730 — DO gap=4.28, pH gap=1.600\",\n    \"VS-03 Day/night pH swing PASS: light_max_pH=7.412 > dark_min_pH=7.308, swing=0.103 within [0.1, 2.0]\",\n    \"VS-04 Source-water differentiation PASS: hard_shrimp pH=8.257, ro_like pH=6.732, gap=1.525 >= 1.0\",\n    \"VS-05 Shrimp breeding PASS: cool pop=260 cycles=10 juv=206 vs warm pop=10 juv=0 — thermal suppression directionally correct\",\n    \"VS-06 Algae-plant competition PASS: plants 8.00g->1.73g, health 0.800->0.000, algae biomass maintained — R* competition confirmed\",\n    \"VS-07 Nitrate removal PASS: planted N2_export=59.97mg_N denitrifier_act=0.816 vs bare N2_export=0.00 — denitrification pathway active\",\n    \"VS-08 Stocking density crash PASS: initial=20 final=0 TAN=275.50 NO2=21.69 — total population collapse from overfeeding\",\n    \"cargo clippy --test e2e_validation_suite -- -D warnings: clean (no warnings)\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check: clean (no formatting issues)\",\n    \"docs/validation_scenarios.md has 8 scenarios with confidence summary table distinguishing 'validated directionally' (high) from 'still heuristic' (medium)\",\n    \"Validation report template at end of docs/validation_scenarios.md ready for G4 calibration workflow auto-population\",\n    \"Scenario confidence coverage: chemistry (VS-01,02,03,04), microbiology (VS-01,07), ecology (VS-06), animal behavior (VS-05), toxicology/husbandry (VS-08)\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"VS-03 pH swing of 0.103 is at the absolute floor of the [0.1, 2.0] envelope — a minor parameter change could push it below threshold. Consider increasing plant biomass or reducing buffering in the test setup for more headroom.\",\n    \"VS-06 and VS-07 carry medium confidence — their envelope bounds may need revision as plant growth and denitrification kinetics get better calibration data from G4.\",\n    \"The validation report template in docs/validation_scenarios.md is a static text format. The G4 calibration workflow (tanksim-6e5.7.4) needs to implement the auto-population logic to produce machine-readable reports.\",\n    \"No cross-seed robustness check: all probes use a single deterministic seed. A future improvement could run each probe with 3-5 seeds to verify envelope stability.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1bda4e08-5585-460a-a8ba-da3a913d857d","total_cost_usd":1.3877128,"usage":{"input_tokens":6999,"cache_creation_input_tokens":79013,"cache_read_input_tokens":503870,"output_tokens":4837,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":79013,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":3323,"outputTokens":22404,"cacheReadInputTokens":1707473,"cacheCreationInputTokens":159949,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.48602654999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":6999,"outputTokens":4837,"cacheReadInputTokens":503870,"cacheCreationInputTokens":79013,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.9016862500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fc4e65b2-ae76-4606-b6b5-67c800d8e855"}
